<H3><CENTER>
<FONT COLOR="#ffff00">Future Meetings</FONT>
</CENTER></H3>

<H2>
<FONT COLOR="#ff0000">Donnington July 29th 2001</FONT>
</H2>
I'm aranging a Tipo meeting on this date at Donnington Race track. The event is
organsied by AutoItalia who say:
<P>
Auto Italia magazine is delighted to announce that we have booked
Donington Park circuit for a track day on Sunday July 29th.
The programme of events will include generous track time,
demonstrations of special cars, passenger rides in competition cars
and classic car parades. Additional attractions will include club displays
and special activities on the Melbourne Loop. Discounted entrance has
also been arranged for visitors to enjoy the Donington Grand Prix collection. 
The opportunity to drive your car at speed on the circuit has been limited to
100 cars and, at a very reasonable &pound;135, early booking is essential
to avoid disappointment. Passenger rides are being offered in full-race
Alfa Romeos driven by experienced competition licence holders at near race speeds.
This chance of a lifetime for just 50 readers is being offered at &pound;35
for five thrilling laps. For those not wishing to over stress their cars or
themselves a session has been reserved for the pleasure of driving on a Grand
Prix circuit for five laps at &pound;20 per car including one passenger. 
<P>
Add to this full programme of action, club displays in the paddock and trade
stands in the pit lane garages then the day will have something for everyone. 
<P>
Spectators are welcome. Entrance is &pound;5 adults and &pound;4 for children
under 16 and OAPs. All the track packages include entry for the car and driver. 
<P>
More details of the track day will be published in Auto Italia magazine. 
<P>
Remember, the on-track packages must be pre-booked and will not be available on the day. 
<P>
Please <A HREF="mailto:donnington@tipo16v.co.uk">email</A> me to be added to the
list of people attending. Of course you can
still attend without emailing me but it's nice to know which will be there.
<UL>
<LI>John Lee (In a Seat Ibiza!)</LI>
<LI><A HREF="../owners/george_roberts.html">George Roberts</A> (In a Turbo Tipo Hopefully!)</LI>
<LI><A HREF="../owners/alexis_grant.html">Alexis Grant</A></LI>
<LI><A HREF="../owners/andy_whitehead.html">Andy Whitehead</A></LI>
<LI><A HREF="../owners/mario_altera.html">Mario Altera</A></LI>
<LI><A HREF="../owners/martin_hodges.html">Martin Hodges</A></LI>
<LI><A HREF="../owners/ian_cull.html">Ian Cull</A></LI>
<LI><A HREF="../owners/robbie_keyworth.html">Robbie Keyworth</A></LI>
<LI><A HREF="../owners/richard_ellingham.html">Richard Ellingham</A></LI>
</UL>


